OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClearer
OL,6,Fskies further west, turning cloudier
OL,7,Ffrom the east, with perhaps the odd
OL,8,Flight shower into the early hours of
OL,9,FTuesday. Chilly, with a touch of frost
OL,10,Fin places and mist and fog patches
OL,11,Fdeveloping under light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FA cloudier day on Tuesday,
OL,14,Fwith the chance of a light shower. The
OL,15,Ffar west holding onto the sunshine and
OL,16,Fremaining dry. Temperatures, around
OL,17,Faverage and feeling similar to Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
