OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FLargely drier on Wednesday, with sunny
OL,7,Fspells. Those showers returning from
OL,8,Fthe east on Thursday into Friday,
OL,9,Fremaining light. Breezier along the
OL,10,Fcoast on Thursday. Chilly nights with
OL,11,Ffrost possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
